    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOZ</strong> is a deck-building card game that ingeniously <strong>fuses the rules of Chinese Poker (&quot;\u70b8\u91d1\u82b1&quot;)</strong>. Collect powerful <strong>Magic Cards</strong> and mystical <strong>Relics</strong> to build your unique deck and become the ultimate adventurer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Deep Deckbuilding, Infinite Combos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no single path to victory! Craft your deck your way: specialize in a single powerful hand type, or mix strategies to adapt. Discover <strong>magical synergies</strong> between Magic Cards and Relics to forge your own winning system!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Character Accessory</strong> defining the core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Relics</strong>, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Magic Cards</strong> to enhance your standard poker cards</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09 A Fantastical World, Your Free Adventure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>bizarre enemies</strong>, each with devious abilities (like <strong>immunity</strong> to certain hands, <strong>death retaliation</strong>, or <strong>growing stronger over time</strong>). Across <strong>3 sprawling chapters</strong>, freely <strong>choose your path</strong>: engage in <strong>combat</strong>, <strong>resupply at shops</strong>, or trigger <strong>mysterious events</strong> \u2013 every choice shapes your deck and journey!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Challenging Monster Cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 Intention Cards</strong> delivering souls-like combat thrills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 Weakness Cards</strong> \u2013 exploit BOSS vulnerabilities and unleash your power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Event Cards</strong> writing unique adventure tales</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Rule the Realm?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOZ masterfully blends the thrill of Chinese Poker with deep deck-building strategy</strong>, enriched by a vast Relic system and adventure driven by your choices. <strong>Build wisely. Play strategically.</strong> Conquer bizarre foes and experience the magical power of cards!</p>",
